{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a Cat. Cause Chaos. Nap Later.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a mischievous house cat in this cozy chaos simulator. Choose your favorite breed and explore fully interactive environments where everything can be knocked over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Cat:</strong> Siamese, British Shorthair, Black Cat, or Calico.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Feline Freedom:</strong> Walk, run, jump, climb, and swipe with physics-based actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whirlwind Spin:</strong> Unleash a powerful spin attack to knock over everything around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your Whirlwind Spin \u2014 grow bigger, spin longer, and recharge faster for maximum chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with Interactive Objects:</strong> Play with toys, scratch pads, or curl up to sleep in a cozy box between bursts of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Environments:</strong> Cause chaos beyond the house \u2014 explore office, bookstore, and supermarket, each packed with unique toys and topple-able items.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Ways to Play:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> Topple all objects in record time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Knock over a set number of objects, then curl up in your bed to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong> No goals, no timers\u2014just endless cozy chaos.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417940?t=1758345634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417940?t=1758345634","